idea_1 = Promote global cooperation and unity;
idea_2 = Focus on sustainable development and equality;
idea_3 = Encourage innovation and education for all;

As ruler of the world, I would prioritize promoting global cooperation and unity, focusing on sustainability and equality, and encouraging innovation and education for everyone. My vision includes establishing a platform where everyone can contribute to the betterment of society and the planet. This approach would ensure that all voices are heard and valued.

To foster global cooperation and unity, I would initiate international dialogue forums and support cross-cultural exchanges. Sustainable development would involve investing in renewable energy sources and green technology, creating infrastructure that benefits all citizens regardless of social status or geographical location. Ensuring equal access to quality education for all would be fundamental, including digital literacy training and resources to help people participate fully in the digital age.

